  "label": "Pastor 1 bio",
  "type": "long",
  "value": "Josh and Alyse both were born and raised in Illinois, USA. They each trusted Christ at a young age through the result of hearing the gospel message. Prior to their move in 2022 to New Zealand, they completed their ministry education through a local university, specialising in international ministries and the launching of new churches.\nPrior to the start of Heritage Baptist Church, Josh served at Grace Independent Baptist Church of Tauranga as an assistant to Pastor Daniel Fraser for two years. They have a shared vision of new churches being started throughout the Bay of Plenty and Waikato regions. Josh brings ten years of ministry experience to the team.\nJosh and Alyse were married in 2018 and have two children, Bentlee and Raelynn.",
